# how say shows lists and boxes: like a person writes them
me is player
me has weapons list "sword" "bow" "dagger"
say "weapons: " + weapons
say weapons

me has bag list
say "bag: " + bag
bag gain "rock"
say "bag: " + bag

me has hero box name "grok" health 100
say hero
say "hero: " + hero

me has team list hero (box name "zug" health 50)
say team
me has grid list (list 1 2) (list 3 4)
say grid
say list 1 (list) (box) (-5)
